# held/props/jingle: a jingle ring of little brass bells on a wooden hoop for the Drum posture's Bells variant (PROPS, P2b),
# shaken high (raise) and out (wave2) in the right hand. Format: rpg/art/doll/doll.h. Anchored on the right shoulder.
use person
legend V linen 0
legend W linen 1
legend X linen 2
legend Y linen 3
legend Z linen 4
legend Q cloth3 0
legend R cloth3 1
legend S cloth3 2
legend T cloth3 3
legend U cloth3 4
legend I metal2 0
legend J metal2 4
body man woman
role held jingle
anchor shoulderR
keys held
z 40

